<body>
<div class="app">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand"><svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 2 24 15 38 20 24 24 20 38 16 24 2 20 16 16Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M28 5 30 10 35 12 30 14 28 19 26 14 21 12 26 10Z" fill="#8d82dc"/></svg>STARFORGE <span class="course mono">X / T1A03 FORMS</span></div>
    <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Main"><a href="index.html">All assignments ↗</a><button type="button" id="openGuide">How it works (i)</button></nav>
  </header>
  <section class="hero">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Orbital design bureau / by Shunta</div><h1>Your next mission<br>starts with a form.</h1><p>Build a spacecraft. Balance its systems. Make it yours.</p></div>
    <div class="hero-aside"><span class="eyebrow muted">Design terminal</span><strong>SF—003</strong><span class="mono muted">Independent exploration division</span></div>
  </section>
  <div class="toolbar">
    <div class="save-state" id="saveState">New design · saved only when you choose</div>
    <div class="tool-actions"><button class="quiet" type="button" id="exampleBtn">Load relay example</button><button class="quiet" type="button" id="saveBtn">Save draft ↓</button><button class="quiet" type="button" id="resetBtn">Reset</button></div>
  </div>
  <main class="main-grid">
    <form id="shipForm" class="config" novalidate>
      <nav class="steps" aria-label="Configuration steps">
        <button type="button" class="step-button" data-step="0" aria-current="step" aria-controls="panel0"><span class="step-number">01</span>Identity</button>
        <button type="button" class="step-button" data-step="1" aria-controls="panel1"><span class="step-number">02</span>Systems</button>
        <button type="button" class="step-button" data-step="2" aria-controls="panel2"><span class="step-number">03</span>Flight check</button>
      </nav>
      <section id="panel0" class="panel" aria-labelledby="identityHeading">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="identityHeading" tabindex="-1">Give your mission a shape.</h2><p>Choose a hull, a destination and a signature color.</p></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="callsign">Spacecraft callsign</label><input class="input" id="callsign" name="callsign" type="text" value="ARCADIA-17" minlength="2" maxlength="22" required autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="callsignHelp"><p class="help" id="callsignHelp">2–22 characters. Invent a name for your spacecraft.</p></div>
        <fieldset class="fieldset"><legend>Hull architecture</legend><div class="hulls">
          <label class="hull-option"><input type="radio" name="hull" value="scout" checked><span class="hull-box"><svg class="mini-ship" viewBox="0 0 60 50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 3 39 27 54 42 34 37 30 45 26 37 6 42 21 27Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><strong>Pathfinder</strong><small>Light / 2 crew</small></span></label>
          <label class="hull-option"><input type="radio" name="hull" value="hauler"><span class="hull-box"><svg class="mini-ship" viewBox="0 0 60 50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M25 4H35L41 20H49V42H37L30 47 23 42H11V20H19Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><strong>Hauler</strong><small>Cargo / 4 crew</small></span></label>
          <label class="hull-option"><input type="radio" name="hull" value="surveyor"><span class="hull-box"><svg class="mini-ship" viewBox="0 0 60 50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 2 37 23 57 32 53 43 35 35 30 47 25 35 7 43 3 32 23 23Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><strong>Surveyor</strong><small>Science / 3 crew</small></span></label>
        </div></fieldset>
        <div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="mission">Mission profile</label><select id="mission" name="mission"><option value="survey">01 / Lunar survey</option><option value="relay">02 / Deep-space relay</option><option value="delivery">03 / Habitat delivery</option></select><p class="help" id="missionHelp"></p></div>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="crew">Crew size</label><input class="input" id="crew" name="crew" type="number" min="1" max="2" step="1" value="2" required aria-describedby="crewHelp"><p class="help" id="crewHelp">This hull seats up to 2.</p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="launchDate">Launch date</label><input class="input" id="launchDate" name="launchDate" type="date" required></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="accent">Signature color</label><div class="colors"><button type="button" class="color-dot" data-color="#7564d8" style="--swatch:#7564d8" aria-label="Violet" aria-pressed="true"></button><button type="button" class="color-dot" data-color="#217d83" style="--swatch:#217d83" aria-label="Lagoon" aria-pressed="false"></button><button type="button" class="color-dot" data-color="#b46a42" style="--swatch:#b46a42" aria-label="Copper" aria-pressed="false"></button><button type="button" class="color-dot" data-color="#4c6da8" style="--swatch:#4c6da8" aria-label="Cobalt" aria-pressed="false"></button><input id="accent" name="accent" type="color" value="#7564d8"><span class="help">or mix your own</span></div></div>
      </section>
      <section id="panel1" class="panel" aria-labelledby="systemsHeading" hidden>
        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="systemsHeading" tabindex="-1">Balance ambition and power.</h2><p>Every system changes your ship's performance and cost.</p></div>
        <div class="field"><div class="range-label"><label class="field-label" for="battery">Battery capacity</label><output id="batteryValue" for="battery">70%</output></div><input id="battery" name="battery" type="range" min="20" max="100" step="5" value="70"><div class="range-ends"><span>Lighter + lower cost</span><span>More range + power</span></div></div>
        <div class="field"><div class="range-label"><label class="field-label" for="thrust">Engine output</label><output id="thrustValue" for="thrust">55%</output></div><input id="thrust" name="thrust" type="range" min="20" max="100" step="5" value="55"><div class="range-ends"><span>Efficient cruising</span><span>Higher speed + power draw</span></div></div>
        <fieldset class="fieldset"><legend>Mission modules</legend>
          <label class="module"><input type="checkbox" name="modules" value="scanner" checked><span class="module-copy"><strong>Surface scanner</strong><small>Map the terrain · draws 14 power</small></span><span class="module-cost">+360 cr</span></label>
          <label class="module"><input type="checkbox" name="modules" value="beacon"><span class="module-copy"><strong>Relay antenna</strong><small>Connect distant stations · draws 12 power</small></span><span class="module-cost">+280 cr</span></label>
          <label class="module"><input type="checkbox" name="modules" value="cargo"><span class="module-copy"><strong>Cargo bay</strong><small>Deliver habitat supplies · draws 9 power</small></span><span class="module-cost">+420 cr</span></label>
          <label class="module"><input type="checkbox" name="modules" value="shield"><span class="module-copy"><strong>Debris shield</strong><small>Optional orbital protection · draws 20 power</small></span><span class="module-cost">+480 cr</span></label>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="readout"><div class="readout-row"><span>Power draw / available</span><strong id="powerDetail"></strong></div><div class="readout-row"><span>Mission budget</span><strong id="budgetDetail"></strong></div></div>
      </section>
      <section id="panel2" class="panel" aria-labelledby="reviewHeading" hidden>
        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="reviewHeading" tabindex="-1">Ready for the departure board?</h2><p>Resolve the checks, then issue your flight manifest.</p></div>
        <div class="readout" id="reviewSummary"></div>
        <ul class="checks" id="checkList" aria-label="Flight checks"></ul>
